# Machine-specific paths. Copy to .env and edit; .env is gitignored.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Both are optional: with no .env the defaults below are used, which work when
# training is launched from the repo root. Set them if your checkout or your
# LOBSTER data lives somewhere else (the data is large and often on another disk).
#
# A real environment variable always wins over a value set here, so one-off
# overrides work too:
#
#   JAXMARL_HFT_DATA=/mnt/lobster ./train_seed.sh 7
#
# Quote any value containing spaces: JAXMARL_HFT_DATA="/Volumes/My Disk/data"

# Repo root. Used for checkpoints/ and the pre_reset_states/ cache.
JAXMARL_HFT_ROOT=.

# Parent directory of rawLOBSTER/, i.e. the layout is
#   $JAXMARL_HFT_DATA/rawLOBSTER/<STOCK>/<TIME_PERIOD>/<STOCK>_<DATE>_..._message_10.csv
JAXMARL_HFT_DATA=./data

# Optional Weights & Biases settings; training runs fine with WANDB_MODE=disabled.
# WANDB_API_KEY=
# WANDB_ENTITY=
# WANDB_PROJECT=
